<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>应届生身份常见问题解答</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
    background: #fff;
    color: #222;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 18px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .title-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    border: 3px solid #e02020;
    border-radius: 50% / 40%;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
  }

  .title-underline {
    height: 6px;
    background: #f5a623;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-top: -8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    width: 95%;
  }

  .item {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .q-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .num-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    background: #f5a623;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .highlight-orange {
    background: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #f5a623;
    padding: 0 1px;
  }

  .highlight-yellow {
    background: #e8e26a;
    padding: 0 1px;
  }

  .highlight-underline-purple {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #b060c0;
    padding: 0 1px;
  }

  .answer {
    padding-left: 26px;
    color: #222;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid #888;
    margin: 10px 0 14px 0;
  }

  .circled {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 1.5px solid #b060c0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #b060c0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 2px;
  }

  .star-annotation {
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px;
    color: #b060c0;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    transform: rotate(-10deg);
  }

  .star1 { top: 4px; }
  .star2 { top: 4px; }

  .item-spacer-large {
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="title-wrap">
    <div class="title">应届生身份常见问题解答</div>
    <div class="title-underline"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 1 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">1</span>
      <span>在读期间交了<span class="highlight-orange">社保</span>算应届生吗？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">算。在读期间实习交的社保不影响毕业应届生身份认定</div>
    <span class="star-annotation star1">☆</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 2 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">2</span>
      <span>寒暑假期间实习，公司交了<span class="highlight-orange">社保</span>算应届生吗？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">算。属于在读期间（非毕业找工作期间）缴纳的都不影响应届生身份认定。</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 3 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">3</span>
      <span>兼取时交了<span class="highlight-orange">工伤保险</span>影响应届生身份吗？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">不影响。还是有应届生身份的。</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 4 -->
  <div class="item item-spacer-large">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">4</span>
      <span><span class="highlight-orange">毕业签了三方还是应届生吗？</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">算。毕业后没有缴纳社保，处于择业期内算应届毕业生</div>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- Item 5 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">5</span>
      <span>应届生身份什么时候失效？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">
      一是毕业以后缴纳了社保，二是超过两年择业期。
    </div>
    <div style="padding-left:26px; margin-top:-6px;">
      <span class="circled">①</span>
      <span class="circled" style="margin-left:60px;">②</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 6 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">6</span>
      <span>虽然毕业了但是公司没有交<span class="highlight-orange">社保</span>算吗？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">处于两年择业期的话，是算的。</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Item 7 -->
  <div class="item">
    <div class="q-line">
      <span class="num-badge">7</span>
      <span>在找工作 签了<span class="highlight-orange">三方协议和劳动合同</span>还算应届生吗？</span>
    </div>
    <div class="answer">
      不算。三方协议不算正式的劳动合同，但签定了正式的<br>
      <span class="highlight-yellow">劳动合同就不算应届毕业生了。</span>
    </div>
    <span class="star-annotation star2" style="bottom:0; right:20px;">☆</span>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
```
